factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  Reel script says the bridge construction 'will start in February 2027' as the headline claim, but also says the service road will be built by December; article says service road is a prerequisite, which the script states only loosely — minor, but the script omits that the district administration's advice is to acquire land before starting, which is the actual condition.
  Reel script says 'தேசிய நெடுஞ்சாலைத்துறை இந்த மேம்பாலத்தைக் கட்ட உள்ளது' and then states the district administration advised land acquisition; the script omits that land acquisition is required, presenting the service road as the only step.
  Reel script states the pipes/cables must be moved to the roadside and that digging for pipes will not be allowed afterward, but omits the condition that this is the department's stated plan, mixing the department's instructions with the district administration's advice into one unclear sentence.
  Slides spec 'ஏன் சர்வீஸ் ரோடு?' slide's first line says the bridge construction between traffic 'causes obstruction', while the article says it 'will be a trouble' — wording is acceptable, but slide 3 'பணி எப்போது?' lists 'குழாய்களை ரோட்டோரத்துக்கு மாற்ற வேண்டும்' without stating it is a department requirement, mixing two facts into one slide line.
  Caption states 'இதனால் ... நிலம் கையகப்படுத்தி சர்வீஸ் ரோடு போட வேண்டும் என மாவட்ட நிர்வாகம் அறிவுறுத்தியது' merging the district administration's advice with the department's service-road action, combining two different facts into one sentence.
